{"id":"vod_sn_35770","vodId":"35770","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"白砂的水族馆","name_cn":"白砂的水族馆","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4c5fc7de14f01c6b00f6a1240f7d8ee6.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在戛玛戛玛水族馆之中，高中生海咲野心（伊藤美来 配音）是水族馆的代理馆长，对于经营水族馆，她充满了热情，也非常喜欢水族馆里的动物们，然而，因为经营不善，水族馆随时面临着倒闭的命运。　　宫泽风花（逢田梨香子 配音）曾经以成为偶像作为自己的理想，然而，在经历了一系列的挫折之后，她选择放弃了理想，并且只身一人来到了冲绳，想要在这里疗伤。在冲绳，风花邂逅了海咲野心，两个女孩之间产生了真挚的友谊。在城市观光协会工作的久高夏凜（Lynn 配音）、经常会去水族馆帮忙的仲村櫂（土屋神葉 配音）、水族馆的饲养员屋嘉间志空也（阿座上洋平 配音），很快，风花就结识了这些好友们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Faz44U8U861/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KXhfgvZKR61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UjMMtaM2cu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6U9C1waHHa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xgtweGScNA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zLDtxfCNbH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fYDbvfQbLy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UWEmx4kYDB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RpZSZddJ3W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xEX9usn0TB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7L3FRsrgdg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XjsTtVvr1i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QGcCqs2Q0r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b9XRZLvwYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集